title: "EACP: Reproducible Artifact for Cross-Plane Operational Provenance"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for a lightweight evidence-aware control plane,
  including a deterministic SQLite microbenchmark, a small single-control-plane
  Kubernetes laboratory evaluation, and a bounded OpenTelemetry Collector
  reference-pipeline comparison. The accompanying manuscript is a non-peer-reviewed
  preprint. The DOI in this record identifies the artifact, not the accompanying
  article.
